# Leave-one-dataset-out on corrected labels (v3)

Train and validate on the two source datasets (per-scenario chronological 80/20), test on every window of the held-out dataset. Corrected labels (bots = originators of bot traffic) and host features from all window flows (data/graphs_v3). Trees: mean ± sd over seeds 42, 1, 2; T-GINE: directed, seed 42, trained and evaluated in FP32. The decision threshold is tuned on the source validation set only; the oracle F1 (best threshold chosen on the target itself) is an upper bound, not a usable result.

